# --- COMMIT END ---
# Type can be:
#    feat     (new feature)
#    fix      (bug fix)
#    docs     (documentation)
#    style    (formatting, no code change)
#    refactor (refactoring code)
#    test     (adding tests, refactoring tests)
#    chore    (updating tasks etc; no code change)
#    perf     (performance improvements)
